      "widgets_values": [
        "Apply the motion from <Video 1> to the character in <Picture 1>.\n\nPrioritize <Picture 1>'s body proportions over the original person in the video.\nDo not follow the original person's adult body proportions.\n<Picture 1> has a chibi / child-like body type with large head, short torso and short limbs.\nRedraw the entire character to strictly match these proportions.\n\nKeep the original video's camera movement, timing, and all physical dynamics completely intact — including body bounce, shaking, weight shift, cloth physics, and any natural jitter or vibration present in <Video 1>.\n\nRedraw hair and clothing from scratch based on <Picture 1>, with natural physics-based movement (hair swaying, bouncing, cloth folding and reacting to motion).\n\nRender in Japanese cel-shaded anime style, limited animation at 24fps (on 2s / on 3s timing), thick clean outlines, and flat coloring.\n\nFollow the input video's motion and camera work exactly. Only replace the character."
      ],
